{
  "slug": "co2-tracker",
  "name": "Co2 Tracker",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Track the carbon footprint of your Claude Code sessions. Adds a live CO2 estimate to the status line, persists sessions to a local SQLite database, and generates shareable PNG report cards. Based on peer-reviewed emission factors from Jegham et al. 2025.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `carbon-card` (Generate shareable PNG report cards of your Claude Code carbon footprint), `carbon-report` (Display CO2 emissions report for Claude Code sessions), `carbon-update` (Update claude-carbon to the latest version and re-price history (CO2-only))\n- **Hooks** (2): `Stop`, `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install co2-tracker@claude-community` from `gwittebolle/claude-carbon`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "hook": 2
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
